Email: admin@cloudinsight.ai
Password: password123

Localy
1 — DB only (Docker)


docker compose up db -d
Postgres starts on localhost:5432. Stop it later with docker compose stop db.

2 — Backend (uvicorn)

First time only — create the .env and install deps:


cd backend
cp .env.example .env
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
Then run:


uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 6000 --reload
3 — Frontend (pnpm)


cd frontend
pnpm install   # first time only
pnpm dev
Opens at http://localhost:3000.

All together (3 terminals):

Terminal	Command
1	docker compose up db -d
2	cd backend && source venv/bin/activate && uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 6000 --reload
